    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456120/extras/0c4f9940109c546304f56d6c9f0d08ac.avif?t=1741560631\" /></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456120/extras/eedd7041da07b4f5be8d68ec40bf66c2.poster.avif?t=1741560631\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456120/extras/eedd7041da07b4f5be8d68ec40bf66c2.webm?t=1741560631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456120/extras/eedd7041da07b4f5be8d68ec40bf66c2.mp4?t=1741560631\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Fully simulated physics!<br></li><li> Choose between the FUN or REALISTIC difficulty. <br></li><li> Endless fun! Refill the machine after winning a set amount of prizes<br></li><li> Collect and inspect 200 prizes! All fully 3D!<br></li><li> Various accessiblity options</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Special Prizes</h2>Special Prizes randomly appear. You have 3 attempts to win them, before they disappear again.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize</h2>Customize your arcade by importing your own image! All aspect ratios are supported. Simply drag and drop a .png or .jpg file into the game.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456120/extras/699b0087cebd34a1933b743311814f47.poster.avif?t=1741560631\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456120/extras/699b0087cebd34a1933b743311814f47.webm?t=1741560631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456120/extras/699b0087cebd34a1933b743311814f47.mp4?t=1741560631\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456120/extras/0c4f9940109c546304f56d6c9f0d08ac.avif?t=1741560631\" /></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456120/extras/eedd7041da07b4f5be8d68ec40bf66c2.poster.avif?t=1741560631\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456120/extras/eedd7041da07b4f5be8d68ec40bf66c2.webm?t=1741560631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456120/extras/eedd7041da07b4f5be8d68ec40bf66c2.mp4?t=1741560631\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Fully simulated physics!<br></li><li> Choose between the FUN or REALISTIC difficulty. <br></li><li> Endless fun! Refill the machine after winning a set amount of prizes<br></li><li> Collect and inspect 200 prizes! All fully 3D!<br></li><li> Various accessiblity options</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Special Prizes</h2>Special Prizes randomly appear. You have 3 attempts to win them, before they disappear again.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize</h2>Customize your arcade by importing your own image! All aspect ratios are supported. Simply drag and drop a .png or .jpg file into the game.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456120/extras/699b0087cebd34a1933b743311814f47.poster.avif?t=1741560631\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456120/extras/699b0087cebd34a1933b743311814f47.webm?t=1741560631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456120/extras/699b0087cebd34a1933b743311814f47.mp4?t=1741560631\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
